A spoiler trap opens beneath you!

You fall onto a set of spoilers.

A djinni from a blessed magic lamp will -always- give you a wish.  A djinni
from a cursed magic lamp will always give you an angry djinni.  A djinni from
an uncursed lamp has a 1 in 5 chance of being: a wish-giver, tame, friendly,
disappearing, or annoyed.
